    ],
    "description": "Belleek\nPorcelain Desk Pen Stand with Pen\nCirca 1990s, Gilt Accents and Nautical Motif\nCrafted by Belleek Pottery in County Fermanagh, Ireland, this glazed porcelain desk stand showcases the maker's renowned craftsmanship in fine ceramic wares. The oval base features low-relief nautical motifs including an embossed scallop shell, starfish, and textured rope border, highlighted by an interior gold-gilt accent line. Complete with an adjustable gold-tone ball-and-socket swivel mount and matching desk pen, it represents both functional executive utility and classic decorative styling.\nGlazed ivory porcelain base with detailed embossed seashell, starfish, and rope motifs\nGilded accent line framing the inner tray recess with matching gold-tone swivel pen cup\nFitted green protective felt underside bearing gold foil Belleek crest; blue trademark on rim\nBase measures approximately 9\" long by 5\" wide\nCondition:\nVery good vintage condition. The porcelain base is free of chips, cracks, or crazing, and the gilded trim remains bright. The green felt underside and maker marks are fully intact. The gold-tone desk pen rests securely in the swivel socket with bright finish, showing clear tape wrapped around the center barrel. Ink cartridge functionality is not guaranteed.\nOnly includes what is shown in pictures, any accessories or items not shown but described cannot be guaranteed to be included with the lot.\nTHANK YOU FOR YOUR PURCHASE!\nIf you’re happy and you know it, please leave a 5-star rating! If there is a problem with your order, please contact us via Shop Goodwill before opening returns/claims. We strive to return all messages within one business day.\nPlease click the shipping estimate link in the listing to get the shipping costs directly from FedEx.  There will be no discounts or price changes after an auction has ended.\nOur shipping team works hard to get out all orders as quickly as possible, that being said it may take up to 5 business days after payment for your order to ship out.  Once it ships out you will receive tracking information.\n***IMPORTANT*** If your item was damaged in transit, do not throw away anything, including the box or packing materials until we have authorized you to do so. Photos will be required to file insurance claims.\nOur Business hours: Monday - Friday  8:00 am to 4:00 pm Central\nNew items and unique treasures are added daily, come back soon!",
