    "description": "Various Crystals, Gemstone, Ores, Volcanic Glass, Minerals Lot\nThis is a previously owned item being sold AS IS. Items may have light surface dust/debris and scratches.\nGems are tested on a Presidium Gem Tester II. Many gemstone properties overlap and could potentially be one of many varieties of gemstones.\nWe do not have the equipment to distinguish between natural and man-made gems.\nThe weight shown in the images has the box and the plastic liner included. Please keep this in mind when bidding.\nItems are represented to the best of our ability. We are not experts in any field. Items are previously owned/used and donated. They may contain unseen flaws which are unable to be ascertain by the staff. All items are sold \"AS IS.\" No Returns or Refunds. Items may be missing cords, batteries, parts, and/or accessories. Please contact us PRIOR to bidding to clarify any questions or concerns.\nREAD ALL BELOW INFORMATION. REFUNDS WILL BE REFUSED IF YOU DO NOT READ THE DETAILS BELOW!\nLOCAL PICKUP INFORMATION\nLocal Pickup Time Slots Are Available:\nMonday - Friday, 1:00pm - 4:00pm.\nAPPOINTMENTS REQUIRED\nLocal Pickup Requirements:\nYou are\nREQUIRED\nto schedule your pickup appointment in an available time slot as well as provide the order number for verification at pickup. If you do not provide your order number or show up outside of your selected time slot, we\nwill NOT dispense your items to you\nand you will need to reschedule your appointment.\nABANDONED ITEMS:\nAfter paying for your auction, you have seven (7) days to schedule a pickup appointment. If you do not schedule your appointment within seven days after paying for your auction, or miss your pickup appointment and do not reschedule it within another 7 days, your items will be considered abandoned and will be processed as a donation\nWITHOUT REFUND\n. If something happens, reach out to us before any deadlines end and we will typically work with you.\nHOW TO SCHEDULE A PICKUP\n:\nPay for your won auction(s) > On Shopgoodwill.com, go to \"Open Orders\" > click/tap on the order you want to pick up > scroll down to \"Schedule Pickup\" > Select an available time slot. If your preferred time slot is not available, that time slot is already full. We are not open on weekends.\nWHERE TO PICKUP\n: Local Pickup is at the Goodwill Outlet store at 2800 Southwest Blvd, Tulsa, OK 74107. Enter the building during you appointment time frame and inform the cashier you have arrived for a Local Pickup order. They will contact a member of our E-commerce team to assist you, so long as you have scheduled an appointment and can provide your order number.\nIs an item Local Pickup Only?:\nCheck the Item Info tab, Shipping Price will show \"Pickup Only\".\nWE DO NOT CONVERT PICKUP ONLY ORDERS TO SHIPPING.\nGENERAL ITEM INFORMATION:\nAll items, including lots/grouped items, are sold\nAS-IS\nPlease ask any questions before bidding.\nDays & Hours of operation:\nMonday-Friday 08:00am - 04:30 pm CTS.\nWe do not work during major holidays or on weekends.\nItem Refunds:\nItems are sold \"AS IS\". We will not refund due to \"Buyer's remorse\". If an item is sent back to us with the claim that incorrect information was listed but a second review on our end shows the listing was accurate, a 20% restocking fee will be applied to the refund.\nItems returned to us will not be shipped back to you\n, regardless of the result of the second review. You have seven (7) days for claims after the merchandise is delivered, after that, we will not process claims, returns, or refunds. If a package is returned to us due to wrong address given or unable to deliver due to signature not being provided, we will be refunding your order minus the shipping cost.\nQuestions?:\nWe describe items to the best of our abilities, but\nwe are not experts in any field.\nEvery item sold here is donated, and all bids are placed with the understanding that all the items are pre-owned and may contain imperfections unnoticed by the staff. Products might have signs of wear, scratches dirt, dust, and other small imperfections due to storage and/or handling. ASK QUESTIONS\nBEFORE",
